# @agent-k/providers

You are in the **providers** package (LLM clients, model registry/routing, health/probe helpers).

## Allowed
- Provider clients, profiles, model lists, routing, tool-call parse/format for LLM streams
- Types used by UI selectors (status, tags) — keep UI-agnostic

## Forbidden
- Importing `src/tools/**`, `src/host/**`, or `src/chat/**`
- VS Code view/webview HTML
- Tool executor logic

## Dependencies
Prefer `@agent-k/providers` imports. May use core config (`ConfigManager`) and small shared types (e.g. thinking effort). Do not grow new edges into host/chat/tools.
